      "role": "user",
      "content": "Yeah, I've looked into the calibration and the sensors seem fine physically. It's just these sudden, random glitches in the telemetry—like they're completely unprovoked. It's getting a bit frustrating because it makes the whole dataset look messy. Do you have any thoughts on why a sensor might behave this way so sporadically? It feels like something is just interfering with the data stream itself.",
